klatt: disable experimental wide path, guard n==0/1 state writeback

User-tuned klatt_fx.c: hard-disable the unfinished wide/double-state path
(wide_on is forced to 0 instead of following EVV_WIDE), skip the n==0
state writeback arm in pole_filter, and drop the upstream debug comments.
Applied at build time so CI builds the same file.
